# Semgrep ignore — excludes non-source files from code-pattern rules.
#
# Lockfiles are generated artifacts, not source code. Scanning them with code
# rules (e.g. unsafe-formatstring) produces false positives. Dependency CVEs in
# lockfiles are already covered by GitHub Dependabot, so excluding them here
# removes noise without losing real coverage.
pnpm-lock.yaml
package-lock.json
yarn.lock
**/pnpm-lock.yaml
**/package-lock.json
**/yarn.lock

